OL,3,ABenefits review to suggest quicker
OL,4,Apayment for some disabled people
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review into the main disability
OL,7,Fbenefit is set to recommend that those
OL,8,Fwith the most severe conditions and
OL,9,Fterminal illnesses should get quicker
OL,10,Fpayments.
OL,12,FThe report on Personal Independence
OL,13,FPayment (Pip), which will be published
OL,14,Fon Tuesday afternoon, will also suggest
OL,15,Fthat assessments are overhauled to
OL,16,Fprovide claimants in England and Wales
OL,17,Fwith more appropriate support.
OL,19,FBut despite the cost of the benefit
OL,20,Fprojected to more than double between
OL,21,F2020 and 2030, the review is understood
OL,22,Fnot to suggest major savings.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
