OL,3,ACan Burnham turn volume down on EU
OL,4,Adebate?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the prime minister told MPs "there
OL,7,Fwill be no banging on about Europe"
OL,8,Ffrom him, my mind flashed back 20
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FIt is 2006 and a fresh faced David
OL,12,FCameron had just taken over as the
OL,13,FConservative leader, promising, yes you
OL,14,Fguessed it, to stop "banging on" about
OL,15,FEurope.
OL,17,FAnd we all know how that turned out: a
OL,18,Fdecade later as prime minister, he held
OL,19,Fand lost a referendum on whether the UK
OL,20,Fshould stay in the European Union, as
OL,21,Fhe advocated, or leave.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
